{
 "describe": "Dates of four kinds of scheduled announcement, 2002-01-01 to 2026-11-20, collected on 2026-11-22 for use as calendar-collision flags. CPI and PPI: the BLS news-release dates, taken as the dates that appear both in ALFRED's release-date list and in the BLS schedule for the year (one main release per reference month). FOMC: the last day of each scheduled meeting, and separately the dates of statements from unscheduled meetings. TSMC earnings: the date of each quarterly results announcement, in Taiwan.",
 "caveats": [
  "Release times of day were not collected.",
  "TSMC earnings dates from 2013Q4 rest on one reading of the company's financial calendar, cross-checked for five quarters.",
  "Which unscheduled FOMC statements count as decisions was not checked against the statement texts.",
  "Customer earnings dates are not included."
 ],
