  "notes": "'dates' = one main BLS PPI news release per reference month (298 dates), 08:30 US Eastern on every date. 'alfred_all_dates' = the full ALFRED list for rid=46 inside the window (318 dates). Reduction rule: keep an ALFRED date only if the BLS archived yearly schedule lists a 'Producer Price Index(es) for <month>' release on that date. Every BLS-listed date is in ALFRED. The 20 ALFRED-only dates are mostly February dates shortly before the January-data release (2009 and 2010 have two each; 2010-02-14 is a Sunday), plus 2004-04-05 and 2005-05-24; reason for the extra postings not confirmed from a source. Note the rule is NOT 'latest date in the month': 2005-05-17 is the release and 2005-05-24 the extra. Delays stated on the BLS 2004 schedule: January 2004 data moved from Feb 19 to 2004-03-18, February data from Mar 12 to 2004-04-01, March data from Apr 8 to 2004-04-22, May data from Jun 11 to 2004-06-17; so there is no PPI release in February 2004 and two in April 2004. 2013-10-29 (September 2013 data, late; shutdown). 2025: after 2025-09-10 the only release is 2025-11-25 (September 2025 data); none in October or December 2025; the BLS schedules list no separate release for October 2025 data. 2026 catch-up: 2026-01-14 (November 2025 data), 2026-01-30 (December 2025 data), 2026-02-27 (January 2026 data), 2026-03-18 (February 2026 data). Last release in window 2026-11-13 (October 2026 data)."
 },
